{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1000_p", "source_sha256": "28f8d8d6dcaa5ace4b720543705599f1362d97093dde05940de48de9322cbb21", "ja": "ライブお疲れさま、千早。\nいいステージだったな。", "zh": "演唱会辛苦了，千早。\n是场很棒的表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "5cbb0dd1888f6806a6901159d088940e35d37172c55d6150a62a619cd0b4e58d", "ja": "はい。自分でもそう思います。\nこれ以上ない、会心のライブにできたかと。", "zh": "是的，我自己也这么认为。\n我觉得这是场令人满意至极的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "026012df931cac731f10386d71b0f2b85eef2465b833f60554397b1556ed7aca", "ja": "これも劇場の仲間と……\n{$P$}のおかげですね。", "zh": "这也是托了剧场的伙伴……\n和{$P$}的福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "55376541ba99a2f052e056ecf3fe07a8aa87c84670eed1865b63ce50fb463abd", "ja": "ステージとは、ひとりで作るものではありませんから。\n今日の私は、まるで子どもの頃のように……。", "zh": "毕竟表演无法独自完成。\n今天的我，就像小时候一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "8ad9b18a7ebff1e304da75779f33b515915430f8f12ff89ca0f7692fbc41daf8", "ja": "心から、歌うことを楽しむことができました。ふふっ。", "zh": "打从心底享受着唱歌这件事，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4beee207fb55c6dacdfb0680003aedf969d054bf3961a72afc53b74d3113e089", "ja": "ああ、舞台袖で俺も楽しませてもらったよ。\nファンのみんなも、最高の夏の思い出になったろうな。", "zh": "嗯，我也在舞台侧边看得很开心。\n这肯定会成为粉丝们心中最棒的夏日回忆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "ba27ddfba1b53ac58e2b168062b72af584d4a50a0c26d2f38e63f6ac797d8662", "ja": "そうなってくれることを、私も……願っています。", "zh": "我也……希望会是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "5a8bbce8db45136b959e6a6cb1c38269556d5e6c0fe8c6876eeac580dba56a21", "ja": "{$P$}。先ほどのライブで、\nやはり私は歌が好きなのだと、改めて実感しました。", "zh": "{$P$}，在刚才的演唱会中，\n我又再一次感受到自己真的很喜欢唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "ac71820f558e65c3822886b6927a3cb985ce7d53d2f760a6b3190dc7deff48e6", "ja": "これからも私に、いろいろな歌を……\nたくさんの歌を、歌わせてください。", "zh": "今后也请让我挑战各式各样的曲风……\n让我唱出许多的歌曲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cb4194fc0ce328fcc39805f556b0da009275dc3e3c86010ab0724e47978c6a17", "ja": "もちろんそのつもりだ。千早にピッタリな歌と\nステージを、これからも用意させてもらうよ。", "zh": "我当然是这么打算的。\n今后我也会为千早准备好最适合的歌曲和舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "c98c8c880c272c164a3b98eb49370112a88053fedaa657f182ab0f06931705b9", "ja": "ありがとうございます……！\nあ、あの……ところで……。", "zh": "谢谢你……！\n那、那个……话说回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "dfa5c6aebd6aa8289d05c7c7b433e573f1fbd544370ef2e5279c41db986c6c87", "ja": "よければ、ですけど……。\nこの後、一緒に花火でも……しませんか？", "zh": "如果方便的话……\n待会要不要一起……去放个烟火？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "1287be5cfb5f25b46c6a40a40645744d381d1b8999ac9a680a1f18f66944d33e", "ja": "その、せっかく海に来たのだからと、つい花火セットを\n買ってしまって！　その……出来心で……。", "zh": "该怎么说……难得有机会来海边，\n我不小心就买了一套烟火！算是……一时兴起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a369843a19403ae6c68f42e692e2327db0198c969cc0e15415fe1135de20dc45", "ja": "おっ、いいじゃないか。\nもう少し暗くなったら、一緒にやろうか。", "zh": "喔，挺不错的啊。\n那等天色暗一点以后，再一起放烟火吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "73d23ec6c66f67c6aa93916ff8f80f9bc1edd32b44010a2c403e5dd63c74b0b7", "ja": "あ……は、はい。", "zh": "啊……好、好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0023_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9013f7dc7a4fc7637c4fa640d4d1a159fe8181a0e2d8f92d16a5cd8e8e0cce99", "ja": "（その後、ふたりで花火を楽しんだ。千早にとって\nいい思い出になったみたいで、良かったな）", "zh": "（那之后，我们两人开心地放了烟火。\n对千早而言似乎也成为了很棒的回忆，真是太好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
